    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0342" n="226" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg226"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 28, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Ruiz matter, your dispatch No. 37. You will draw on the Secretary of State $400
                    and pay Ruiz in full settlement of his claim. When you make the payment point
                    out to the Foreign Office that there is no legal liability attaching to this
                    Government in the matter, but in view of all the circumstances the payment is
                    made as an act of grace.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
